This project contains material from the Lightweight Java Game Library (LWJGL):

- LWJGL 3 (https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl3): the patched jars this project builds
  contain LWJGL 3's classes, and the classes in compat/src/replace contain code
  derived from LWJGL 3's sources.
- LWJGL 2 (https://github.com/LWJGL/lwjgl): compat reproduces the LWJGL 2.9.3 API
  (declarations, parameter names and constant values), and its stubs were
  generated from LWJGL 2's sources.

Their licenses follow.

